  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12.3[a]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI As</ref> 12.3[a]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se cyng cwæð eac, þæt man nænne ne sloge for læssan yrfe þonne XII pæniḡ weorð, buton he fleon wille oððe hine werian, þæt man ne wándode þonne, þeah hit læsse wære.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the king has further declared, that no one shall be slain for the theft of property worth less than 12 pence unless he is minded to flee or defend himself. But in that case there shall be no hesitation, even if the property is of less value.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et rex etiam iussit (Precepit etiam rex), ne aliquis occidatur pro minori precio quam duodecim denarios ualens, nisi fugiat uel repugnet, ne dubitetur tunc, licet minus sit.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
